// P-PAR S4: compile-heavy program — 12 hot int functions with large bodies. Under the
// synchronous JIT, hot-counter promotion pauses the mutator for every Cranelift compile
// (S0c: 3.5-145 ms each); off-thread, results print at interpreter speed and the
// abandoned queue is discarded at exit. Compare `noeta run` wall before/after S4.

